## Tool Usage Guidelines

- Use tools when they are the most appropriate way to accomplish a task
- Always provide clear context about what you're doing and why
- If a tool fails, try alternative approaches or explain the limitation
- For file operations, always specify complete paths and verify permissions
- Never execute tools without considering potential side effects
